{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《中年好聲音3》七強選手占士丁丁（Dan James）日前在社交平台為粉絲送上驚喜，分享了一張與韓國天團BIGBANG隊長G-Dragon（權志龍）的合照。兩人難得同框，隨即在網上掀起熱話，引來大批網民及粉絲熱烈討論！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">原來，日前（18日）正值G-Dragon的38歲生日，占士丁丁特意發文為對方送上生日祝福，並分享了兩人相識的經過<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">：「Happy birthday to my bro! The Legend!! @xxxibgdrgn , a few months ago in Dubai I was your DJ for KRAZY concert! I managed to catch you backstage and you kindly offer me a drink and we had a little chat! You’re Super humble and down to earth bro! （生日快樂！ @xxxibgdrgn，幾個月前在杜拜，我曾在KRAZY演唱會上擔任你的DJ。當時有幸在後台見到了你，你不僅親切地請我喝了一杯，我們還簡單聊了幾句。兄弟，你真的超級謙遜又平易近人！）」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b177d1d9-3033-4a1f-aa0b-c8deaf0d4592.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026JrpVw0QA1t1787193101.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b177d1d9-3033-4a1f-aa0b-c8deaf0d4592.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ff0e712d-ab5a-4b09-ad15-7c47ea40fb9c.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ScJtSGIqqV1787193101.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ff0e712d-ab5a-4b09-ad15-7c47ea40fb9c.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從曝光的合照可見，手持酒杯的占士丁丁展露燦爛笑容；而身旁以粉紅色背心造型示人的G-Dragon，則舉起精緻的小擺件擋在臉前，盡展鬼馬調皮的一面。這則帖文發出後，不僅驚喜獲得G-Dragon本尊親自點讚，大批網民更紛紛湧入留言區，直呼極度羨慕：「OMGG lucky u!!!」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T04:00:01.207324+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":653,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}